  "grammar": [
    {
      "id": "b3_u05_l2_g1",
      "pattern": "V-(으)ㄴ/는/(으)ㄹ 것 같다",
      "meaning_uz": "...ganga / ...yotganga / ...adiganga o'xshaydi (fe'l)",
      "meaning_en": "It seems / I think (verbs)",
      "explanation_md": "**것 같다** — taxmin yoki yumshoq fikr: \"**...ga o'xshaydi**\", \"**shekilli**\". Fe'l bilan zamonga qarab uch shakli bor.\n\n**몸살이 난 것 같아요.** — *Shamollab qolganga o'xshayman.*\n\n| Zamon | Shakl | Misol |\n|---|---|---|\n| O'tgan | **-(으)ㄴ 것 같다** | 감기에 걸**린** 것 같아요 — *shamollaganga o'xshayman* |\n| Hozir | **-는 것 같다** | 독감이 유행하**는** 것 같아요 — *gripp tarqalayotganga o'xshaydi* |\n| Kelasi | **-(으)ㄹ 것 같다** | 비가 **올** 것 같아요 — *yomg'ir yog'adiganga o'xshaydi* |\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- **ㄹ** tushadi: 살다 → **사는/산** 것 같아요, 만들다 → **만든** 것 같아요\n- Ko'pincha xushmuomala fikr bildirish uchun: **이게 더 좋은 것 같아요.** — *Menimcha, bu yaxshiroq.*\n- **아마** (ehtimol) bilan birga keladi: **아마 비가 올 것 같아요.**",
      "explanation_md_en": "**것 같다** expresses a guess or a softened opinion: \"**it seems**\", \"**I think**\". With verbs it has three forms by tense.\n\n**몸살이 난 것 같아요.** — *I think I've come down with something.*\n\n| Tense | Form | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| Past | **-(으)ㄴ 것 같다** | 감기에 걸**린** 것 같아요 — *I think I've caught a cold* |\n| Present | **-는 것 같다** | 독감이 유행하**는** 것 같아요 — *it seems the flu is going around* |\n| Future | **-(으)ㄹ 것 같다** | 비가 **올** 것 같아요 — *it looks like it'll rain* |\n\n### Remember\n\n- **ㄹ** drops: 살다 → **사는/산** 것 같아요, 만들다 → **만든** 것 같아요\n- It's often used to soften an opinion: **이게 더 좋은 것 같아요.** — *I think this one is better.*\n- It pairs with **아마** (probably): **아마 비가 올 것 같아요.**",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "O'tgan",
          "condition_en": "Past",
          "rule": "V-(으)ㄴ 것 같다",
          "example": "난 것 같아요, 걸린 것 같아요"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "Hozir",
          "condition_en": "Present",
          "rule": "V-는 것 같다",
          "example": "유행하는 것 같아요"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "Kelasi",
          "condition_en": "Future",
          "rule": "V-(으)ㄹ 것 같다",
          "example": "올 것 같아요, 결석할 것 같아요"
        }
      ],
