      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '...ga o'xshaydi', '... shekilli' bilan bir xil: 'shamollaGANGA O'XSHAYMAN' = 감기에 걸린 것 같아요. Zamon fe'lning qo'shimchasida.",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'I think …' or 'it seems …': 'I think I caught a cold' = 감기에 걸린 것 같아요. The tense goes on the verb before 것."
