          "audio": "1a50e8440a94.mp3"
        },
        {
          "ko": "내일은 추울 것 같아요.",
          "uz": "Ertaga sovuq bo'ladiganga o'xshaydi.",
          "en": "It looks like it'll be cold tomorrow.",
          "audio": "1a014fbcf059.mp3"
