      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada sifat bilan ham '...ga o'xshaydi': 'charchaGANGA O'XSHAYSIZ' = 피곤한 것 같아요; 'sovuq bo'ladiGANGA O'XSHAYDI' = 추울 것 같아요.",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'you seem tired' / 'it looks like it'll be cold': 피곤한 것 같아요 / 추울 것 같아요."
