  "dialogue": {
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "아지즈 씨, 얼굴색이 안 좋아요. 어디 아파요?",
        "uz": "Aziz, rangingiz yaxshi emas. Biror joyingiz og'riyaptimi?",
        "en": "Aziz, you look pale. Are you unwell?",
        "audio": "83dcee13451a.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "몸살이 난 것 같아요. 온몸이 아프고 열이 나요.",
        "uz": "Shamollab qolganga o'xshayman. Butun badanim og'riyapti, isitmam bor.",
        "en": "I think I've come down with something. I ache all over and have a fever.",
        "audio": "a043a12ed4ec.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "기침도 해요?",
        "uz": "Yo'tal ham bormi?",
        "en": "Are you coughing too?",
        "audio": "1bffaf7e01a9.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "네, 기침도 하고 콧물도 나요. 목도 아파요.",
        "uz": "Ha, yo'tal ham, tumov ham bor. Tomog'im ham og'riyapti.",
        "en": "Yes, I'm coughing and have a runny nose. My throat hurts too.",
        "audio": "f30937dcaf90.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "요즘 독감이 유행하는 것 같아요. 병원에 가 봤어요?",
        "uz": "Shu kunlarda gripp tarqalganga o'xshaydi. Kasalxonaga bordingizmi?",
        "en": "It seems the flu is going around. Have you been to the doctor?",
        "audio": "97b29c36b42b.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "아니요, 아직이요. 그냥 약국에서 약을 사 먹으려고 해요.",
        "uz": "Yo'q, hali. Shunchaki dorixonadan dori olib ichmoqchiman.",
        "en": "No, not yet. I was just going to buy medicine at the pharmacy.",
        "audio": "f4254b4c5328.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "열이 많이 나니까 내과에 가서 진찰을 받으세요.",
        "uz": "Isitmangiz baland, terapevtga borib ko'rikdan o'ting.",
        "en": "You have a high fever, so go to internal medicine and get checked.",
        "audio": "465bdea5f603.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "네, 그럴게요. 오늘 수업은 결석할 것 같아요.",
        "uz": "Xo'p, shunday qilaman. Bugun darsga bora olmaydiganga o'xshayman.",
        "en": "Okay, I will. I think I'll have to miss class today.",
        "audio": "6d2c49f335fe.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "제가 선생님께 말씀드릴게요. 무리하지 마세요.",
        "uz": "Men o'qituvchiga aytib qo'yaman. O'zingizni zo'riqtirmang.",
        "en": "I'll tell the teacher. Don't overdo it.",
        "audio": "8b734b85c521.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "고마워요. 내일은 괜찮을 것 같아요.",
        "uz": "Rahmat. Ertaga yaxshi bo'ladiganga o'xshayman.",
        "en": "Thanks. I think I'll be fine tomorrow.",
        "audio": "ba878823ed28.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "따뜻한 물을 많이 마시고 푹 쉬세요. 빨리 나으세요!",
        "uz": "Iliq suv ko'p iching va yaxshilab dam oling. Tezroq tuzaling!",
        "en": "Drink lots of warm water and get plenty of rest. Get well soon!",
        "audio": "95d78f0ec173.mp3"
      }
    ]
  },
